@VerizonSupport I need help. I do not have your service (6+ hours to setup and cancel an install!)  but the previous homeowner did. There is an ONT in the basement that sends out a loud, very annoying beep every 15 minutes? This is ridiculous. How do I stop it? @633638 Press and hold the alarm silence button/ONT reboot button on the unit for 30 seconds.  That will silence it.
^ACM @633638 Try unplugging the power and removing the battery. After 3mins, put the battery back in and power on. This should help with the beeping. Let us know. ^DDG @633638 Yes, you can do that since you do not have service with us. When the battery is dead the beeping will stop. 
^HSB

